# Markdownlint on change

When creating or modifying Markdown files, run markdownlint and fix any issues you introduce.

Use the CLI installed globally:

- Lint current file: `markdownlint "<path>"`
- Lint a set of files: `markdownlint "**/*.{md,mdx,mdc}"`

If markdownlint reports issues, address them before finishing.
